{#- for: skill
    output: skills/{{ skill.dir }}/SKILL.md

  The built-in base template for GitHub Copilot CLI (component-registry 2.1.0, ADR-0077): a
  skill's SKILL.md exactly as the resolved view holds it, its front matter, then its body. Copilot
  CLI reads the same SKILL.md as Claude Code (front matter name, lower-case with hyphens, and
  description, both required by Copilot). A layer replaces this file whole
  (templates/copilot/SKILL.md.j2 in the layer), or changes one block:

    {% extends "component-registry/SKILL.md.j2" %}
    {% block body %}{{ super() }}
    One more line.
    {% endblock %}

  The context is in the component-registry notes ("Vendor templates"). -#}
{%- block front_matter %}{{ skill.front_matter }}{% endblock -%}
{%- block body %}{{ skill.body }}{% endblock -%}
